{title: Greater is He that is in me}
{subtitle: Hymnal 341}
{x_theme: holy-spirit, baptism}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Greater is He that is in me.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Greater is He that is in me, Greater is He that is in me
Greater is He that is in me then he that is in the world

{comment: Verse 1}
Satans’s like a roaring lion Roaming to and fro
Seeking whom he may devour, The Bible tells me so
Many souls have been his prey To fall in some weak hour
But God has promised us today His overcoming power

{comment: Verse 2}
On the day of Pentecost A rushing mighty wind
Blew into the upper room And baptized all of them
With a power greater then any earthly foe
I’m so glad I got it too, I’m gonna let the whole world know
